<title>USA: Mecklermedia stake cut by investor.</title>
<headline>Mecklermedia stake cut by investor.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York investment manager Barry Feirstein said Friday he reduced his stake in Mecklermedia Corp to 500,000 shares or 5.9 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, Feirstein, who owns the New York investment management firm Feirstein Capital Management Corp, said he sold a net of 100,000 shares between March 20 and April 16 at $23.75 to $29.48 each.</p>
</text>
